# Wave T28 (Fairhaven kit): marketstall — one of the canvas market
# stalls of the approved design (MANIFEST row 42: "canvas market
# over the north street in two rows"; transferred to the shipped
# market ground at the FAIRHAVEN MARKET sign + MARKET CRIER VESK's
# post — WAVE-T28-FAIRHAVEN-PLAN.md §3.1). A cream striped canvas
# awning on two posts, a counter with the crier's goods (berry
# bowls, jars — "Berries! Stones!"). FULLY OPAQUE by design: it
# stands on the town green, whose tg-slateport tone (measured flat
# #248917, with its shading derivatives) is baked in as its
# ground, never transparency (the T25 scales / T26 travstone /
# T27 barbells precedent).
PIX tile-prop-marketstall 16 16
